[metadata] {"type": "create", "filePath": "/app/output/poster.html", "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>AI in Clinical Decision-Making - Academic Poster</title>
<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;600;700;800&family=Source+Sans+3:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Source+Serif+4:wght@400;600;700&display=swap');

  :root {
    --navy: #1B2A4A;
    --navy-light: #2C3E5A;
    --teal: #2D8C8C;
    --teal-light: #3AA3A3;
    --gold: #C4973B;
    --gold-light: #D4AA52;
    --red: #C0392B;
    --red-light: #E74C3C;
    --white: #FFFFFF;
    --off-white: #F7F8FA;
    --gray-50: #F5F6F8;
    --gray-100: #EBEDF0;
    --gray-200: #D1D5DB;
    --gray-300: #9CA3AF;
    --gray-600: #5D6D7E;
    --gray-800: #2C3E50;
    --text: #2C3E50;
    --text-light: #5D6D7E;
  }

  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

  body {
    font-family: 'Source Sans 3', 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    background: var(--white);
    color: var(--text);
    width: 3200px;
    height: 4525px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .poster {
    width: 3200px;
    height: 4525px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    background: var(--white);
  }

  /* ===== HEADER ===== */
  .header {
    background: var(--navy);
    color: var(--white);
    padding: 48px 72px 36px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .header::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    height: 6px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--teal), var(--gold), var(--teal));
  }
  .header-venue {
    font-family: 'Source Sans 3', sans-serif;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--teal-light);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .header-title {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 62px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    max-width: 2800px;
  }
  .header-subtitle {
    font-family: 'Source Sans 3', sans-serif;
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
    max-width: 2600px;
  }
  .header-meta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 40px;
    margin-top: 24px;
    font-size: 19px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65);
  }
  .header-meta span { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }

  /* ===== MAIN CONTENT ===== */
  .main {
    flex: 1;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    grid-template-rows: auto auto 1fr;
    gap: 0;
  }

  /* ===== SECTION STYLES ===== */
  .section {
    padding: 48px 56px;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--gray-100);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gray-100);
    position: relative;
  }
  .section:last-child { border-right: none; }
  .section-label {
    font-family: 'Source Sans 3', sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--teal);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 36px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--navy);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 16px;
    border-bottom: 3px solid var(--teal);
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .section p {
    font-size: 21px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  /* ===== BACKGROUND SECTION ===== */
  .section-background {
    grid-column: 1;
    grid-row: 1;
  }
  .highlight-text {
    font-size: 23px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--navy-light);
    font-weight: 500;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--gold);
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin: 24px 0;
  }

  /* ===== DIAGNOSTIC PERFORMANCE SECTION ===== */
  .section-diagnostic {
    grid-column: 2;
    grid-row: 1 / 3;
  }

  /* Comparison cards */
  .comparison-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }
  .comparison-card {
    flex: 1;
    background: var(--gray-50);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 32px 28px;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    border: 2px solid transparent;
  }
  .comparison-card.ai {
    border-color: var(--teal);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(45,140,140,0.08), rgba(45,140,140,0.02));
  }
  .comparison-card.clinician {
    border-color: var(--navy-light);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(27,42,74,0.06), rgba(27,42,74,0.02));
  }
  .comparison-card .card-label {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gray-600);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .comparison-card.ai .card-label { color: var(--teal); }
  .comparison-card.clinician .card-label { color: var(--navy); }
  .comparison-card .big-number {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 88px;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .comparison-card.ai .big-number { color: var(--teal); }
  .comparison-card.clinician .big-number { color: var(--navy); }
  .comparison-card .metric-label {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--gray-600);
  }
  .vs-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    background: var(--white);
    border: 3px solid var(--gold);
    border-radius: 50%;
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--gold);
    z-index: 2;
  }
  .comparison-wrapper {
    position: relative;
  }
  .comparison-wrapper .vs-badge {
    left: 50%;
    top: 45%;
  }
  .sensitivity-row { margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .specificity-row { margin-top: 16px; }

  /* Domain chart */
  .domain-chart {
    margin-top: 32px;
  }
  .domain-chart-title {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .domain-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .domain-label {
    width: 160px;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--navy);
    text-align: right;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .domain-bars {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 5px;
  }
  .domain-bar-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .domain-bar {
    height: 26px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    position: relative;
    min-width: 4px;
  }
  .domain-bar.ai { background: var(--teal); }
  .domain-bar.clinician { background: var(--navy-light); opacity: 0.55; }
  .domain-bar-value {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--gray-600);
    white-space: nowrap;
    min-width: 52px;
  }
  .domain-bar-label {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--gray-300);
    width: 20px;
  }
  .domain-legend {
    display: flex;
    gap: 28px;
    margin-top: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .domain-legend-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--gray-600);
  }
  .domain-legend-swatch {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }
  .domain-legend-swatch.ai { background: var(--teal); }
  .domain-legend-swatch.clinician { background: var(--navy-light); opacity: 0.55; }

  /* Turnaround callout */
  .turnaround-callout {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 20px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(196,151,59,0.12), rgba(196,151,59,0.04));
    border-left: 5px solid var(--gold);
    border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0;
    padding: 24px 32px;
    margin-top: 28px;
  }
  .turnaround-number {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 64px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--gold);
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .turnaround-desc {
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--navy);
  }
  .turnaround-desc strong { font-weight: 700; }

  /* ===== SAFETY SECTION ===== */
  .section-safety {
    grid-column: 1;
    grid-row: 2;
  }
  .bias-warning {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(192,57,43,0.1), rgba(192,57,43,0.03));
    border: 2px solid var(--red);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 32px;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .bias-warning-number {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 80px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--red);
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .bias-warning-label {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--red);
    margin-top: 8px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }
  .bias-warning-desc {
    font-size: 19px;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-top: 12px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .disparity-callout {
    background: var(--gray-50);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 24px;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }
  .disparity-callout p {
    font-size: 19px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .disparity-callout p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .disparity-range {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--red);
  }

  /* ===== IMPLEMENTATION GAP SECTION ===== */
  .section-gap {
    grid-column: 1 / 3;
    grid-row: 3;
    display: flex;
    gap: 48px;
    border-right: none;
  }
  .gap-left {
    flex: 1.1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .anchor-stat {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 56px 48px;
    border: 4px solid var(--teal);
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(45,140,140,0.08) 0%, rgba(45,140,140,0.02) 100%);
    width: 100%;
    position: relative;
  }
  .anchor-stat::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -2px; left: -2px; right: -2px; bottom: -2px;
    border-radius: 22px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--teal), var(--gold));
    z-index: -1;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }
  .anchor-stat-number {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 160px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--teal);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -4px;
  }
  .anchor-stat-label {
    font-family: 'Source Sans 3', sans-serif;
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 5px;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  .anchor-stat-desc {
    font-size: 22px;
    color: var(--gray-600);
    margin-top: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .gap-right {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .fda-stat {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    padding-bottom: 24px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--gray-100);
  }
  .fda-number {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 56px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--navy);
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .fda-label {
    font-size: 20px;
    color: var(--gray-600);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .barriers-title {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }
  .barrier-list {
    list-style: none;
  }
  .barrier-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    background: var(--gray-50);
    border-radius: 8px;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--teal);
  }
  .barrier-item .barrier-icon {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    background: var(--teal);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: white;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .barrier-item .barrier-text {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--navy);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .barrier-item .barrier-desc {
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--gray-600);
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  /* ===== RECOMMENDATIONS ===== */
  .section-recommendations {
    grid-column: 1 / 3;
    background: var(--navy);
    color: var(--white);
    padding: 48px 72px;
    border: none;
  }
  .section-recommendations .section-label { color: var(--gold); }
  .section-recommendations .section-title {
    color: var(--white);
    border-bottom-color: var(--gold);
  }
  .rec-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .rec-card {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 28px 22px;
    border-top: 4px solid var(--teal);
  }
  .rec-card:nth-child(4) { border-top-color: var(--gold); }
  .rec-card:nth-child(5) { border-top-color: var(--gold); }
  .rec-number {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 40px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--teal);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .rec-card:nth-child(4) .rec-number,
  .rec-card:nth-child(5) .rec-number { color: var(--gold); }
  .rec-title {
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--white);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .rec-desc {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  /* ===== FOOTER ===== */
  .footer {
    background: var(--navy);
    padding: 24px 72px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .footer-text {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
  }
  .footer-right {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
    text-align: right;
  }

  /* ===== INFOGRAPHIC CONTAINER ===== */
  .infographic-container {
    width: 100%;
    height: 320px;
    margin-top: 24px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="poster">

  <!-- HEADER -->
  <div class="header">
    <div class="header-venue">The Lancet Digital Health &mdash; AI in Clinical Medicine Symposium 2023</div>
    <div class="header-title">Artificial Intelligence in Clinical Decision-Making: Performance, Safety, and Implementation Gaps</div>
    <div class="header-subtitle">A synthesis of current evidence on AI-assisted clinical decision support systems, highlighting diagnostic accuracy gains, safety considerations, and the translational gap from research to bedside deployment.</div>
    <div class="header-meta">
      <span>Systematic Review of 400+ Studies</span>
      <span>The Lancet Digital Health, 2023</span>
      <span>Diagnostic &middot; Prognostic &middot; Therapeutic Domains</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- MAIN CONTENT -->
  <div class="main">

    <!-- BACKGROUND & MOTIVATION -->
    <div class="section section-background">
      <div class="section-label">01 / Background</div>
      <div class="section-title">Background &amp; Motivation</div>
      <p>The integration of artificial intelligence into clinical decision-making represents one of the most rapidly evolving frontiers in digital health. A growing body of evidence examines how machine-learning-based clinical decision support systems (CDSS) perform across diagnostic, prognostic, and therapeutic domains.</p>
      <div class="highlight-text">
        Despite promising results in controlled research settings, the translation of AI tools into routine clinical practice remains profoundly limited.
      </div>
      <p>Understanding the magnitude of this gap &mdash; and the factors driving it &mdash; is essential for researchers, clinicians, regulators, and health-system leaders seeking to harness AI safely and effectively.</p>

      <!-- Infographic: Key context visualization -->
      <div id="infographic-bg" class="infographic-container"></div>
