<body>

<div class="poster">

  <!-- HEADER -->
  <div class="header">
    <div class="header-top">
      <div class="header-venue">The Lancet Digital Health &mdash; AI in Clinical Medicine Symposium</div>
      <div class="header-badge">Original Research</div>
    </div>
    <div class="header-title">Artificial Intelligence in Clinical Decision-Making: Performance, Safety, and Implementation Gaps</div>
    <div class="header-subtitle">A systematic synthesis of evidence on AI-assisted clinical decision support systems &mdash; diagnostic accuracy gains, safety considerations, and the translational gap from research to bedside deployment.</div>
    <div class="header-meta">
      <span>Systematic Review of 400+ Studies</span>
      <span>The Lancet Digital Health, 2023</span>
      <span>Diagnostic &middot; Prognostic &middot; Therapeutic</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ANCHOR STRIP — <5% VISUALLY DOMINANT -->
  <div class="anchor-strip">
    <div class="anchor-number">&lt;5%</div>
    <div class="anchor-divider"></div>
    <div class="anchor-text">
      <div class="anchor-label">Prospective Validation Rate</div>
      <div class="anchor-desc">of AI models published in peer-reviewed literature have undergone prospective clinical validation in real-world settings &mdash; a stark illustration of the research-to-practice chasm.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- MAIN CONTENT -->
  <div class="main">

    <!-- BACKGROUND & MOTIVATION -->
    <div class="section section-background">
      <div class="section-label">01 / Background</div>
      <div class="section-title">Background &amp; Motivation</div>
      <p>The integration of artificial intelligence into clinical decision-making represents one of the most rapidly evolving frontiers in digital health. A growing body of evidence examines how machine-learning-based clinical decision support systems (CDSS) perform across diagnostic, prognostic, and therapeutic domains.</p>
      <div class="highlight-text">
        Despite promising results in controlled research settings, the translation of AI tools into routine clinical practice remains profoundly limited.
      </div>
      <p>Understanding the magnitude of this gap &mdash; and the factors driving it &mdash; is essential for researchers, clinicians, regulators, and health-system leaders.</p>

      <div class="key-stats-row">
        <div class="key-stat-card">
          <div class="key-stat-value">692</div>
          <div class="key-stat-label">FDA-Cleared AI/ML Devices (2023)</div>
        </div>
        <div class="key-stat-card">
          <div class="key-stat-value">32%</div>
          <div class="key-stat-label">Faster Diagnostic Turnaround</div>
        </div>
        <div class="key-stat-card">
          <div class="key-stat-value">&lt;1%</div>
          <div class="key-stat-label">Adverse Events Reported</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Infographic component -->
      <div id="infographic-bg" class="infographic-container"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- DIAGNOSTIC PERFORMANCE -->
    <div class="section section-diagnostic">
      <div class="section-label">02 / Performance</div>
      <div class="section-title">Diagnostic Performance of AI Systems</div>

      <!-- Sensitivity Comparison -->
      <div class="comparison-pair">
        <div class="comparison-pair-label">Diagnostic Sensitivity (Median)</div>
        <div class="comparison-row">
          <div class="comparison-card ai">
            <div class="card-label">AI-Assisted</div>
            <div class="big-number">87.5<span style="font-size:40px">%</span></div>
            <div class="metric-label">Median Sensitivity <span class="delta-badge">+9.3 pp</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="vs-divider">VS</div>
          <div class="comparison-card clinician">
            <div class="card-label">Clinician-Only</div>
            <div class="big-number">78.2<span style="font-size:40px">%</span></div>
            <div class="metric-label">Median Sensitivity</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Specificity Comparison -->
      <div class="comparison-pair">
        <div class="comparison-pair-label">Diagnostic Specificity (Median)</div>
        <div class="comparison-row">
          <div class="comparison-card ai">
            <div class="card-label">AI-Assisted</div>
            <div class="big-number">93.1<span style="font-size:40px">%</span></div>
            <div class="metric-label">Median Specificity <span class="delta-badge">+1.7 pp</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="vs-divider">VS</div>
          <div class="comparison-card clinician">
            <div class="card-label">Clinician-Only</div>
            <div class="big-number">91.4<span style="font-size:40px">%</span></div>
            <div class="metric-label">Median Specificity</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Domain Performance Chart -->
      <div class="domain-chart">
        <div class="domain-chart-header">
          <div class="domain-chart-title">Sensitivity by Clinical Domain</div>
          <div class="domain-legend">
            <div class="domain-legend-item"><div class="domain-legend-swatch ai"></div> AI-Assisted</div>
            <div class="domain-legend-item"><div class="domain-legend-swatch clinician"></div> Clinician-Only</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="domain-row">
          <div class="domain-label">Radiology</div>
          <div class="domain-bars">
            <div class="domain-bar-row">
              <div class="domain-bar ai" style="width: 89.3%"></div>
              <div class="domain-bar-value">89.3%</div>
            </div>
            <div class="domain-bar-row">
              <div class="domain-bar clinician" style="width: 79.8%"></div>
              <div class="domain-bar-value">79.8%</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="domain-row">
          <div class="domain-label">Dermatology</div>
          <div class="domain-bars">
            <div class="domain-bar-row">
              <div class="domain-bar ai" style="width: 86.7%"></div>
              <div class="domain-bar-value">86.7%</div>
            </div>
            <div class="domain-bar-row">
              <div class="domain-bar clinician" style="width: 76.5%"></div>
              <div class="domain-bar-value">76.5%</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="domain-row">
          <div class="domain-label">Ophthalmology</div>
          <div class="domain-bars">
            <div class="domain-bar-row">
              <div class="domain-bar ai" style="width: 90.1%"></div>
              <div class="domain-bar-value">90.1%</div>
            </div>
            <div class="domain-bar-row">
              <div class="domain-bar clinician" style="width: 82.3%"></div>
              <div class="domain-bar-value">82.3%</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="domain-row">
          <div class="domain-label">Pathology</div>
          <div class="domain-bars">
            <div class="domain-bar-row">
              <div class="domain-bar ai" style="width: 84.0%"></div>
              <div class="domain-bar-value">84.0%</div>
            </div>
            <div class="domain-bar-row">
              <div class="domain-bar clinician" style="width: 74.1%"></div>
              <div class="domain-bar-value">74.1%</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Turnaround Time -->
      <div class="turnaround-callout">
        <div class="turnaround-number">32%</div>
        <div class="turnaround-desc">
          <strong>Reduction in diagnostic turnaround time</strong> with AI-assisted workflows &mdash; critical for emergency and time-sensitive care.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- SAFETY, BIAS & EQUITY -->
    <div class="section section-safety">
      <div class="section-label">03 / Safety</div>
      <div class="section-title">Safety, Bias, and Health Equity</div>

      <!-- 18% Warning Callout -->
      <div class="bias-warning">
        <div class="bias-warning-left">
          <div class="bias-warning-number">18%</div>
          <div class="bias-warning-label">Bias Assessed</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bias-warning-desc">
          of published studies reported any formal assessment of algorithmic bias across demographic groups (age, sex, ethnicity, socioeconomic status)
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="disparity-callout">
        <p>Among studies that did assess bias, performance disparities of <span class="disparity-range">5&ndash;12 pp</span> in sensitivity were documented for underrepresented populations &mdash; particularly in dermatology AI trained predominantly on lighter skin tones.</p>
        <p>Adverse safety events attributable to AI were reported in fewer than 1% of prospective trials, but under-reporting is suspected. The absence of standardised safety-reporting frameworks remains a critical gap.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- IMPLEMENTATION GAP -->
    <div class="section section-gap">
      <div class="section-label">04 / Implementation</div>
      <div class="section-title">The Translational Gap</div>

      <div class="fda-stat">
        <div class="fda-number">692</div>
        <div class="fda-label">AI/ML-enabled medical devices granted FDA regulatory clearance as of 2023</div>
      </div>

      <div class="barriers-title">Key Barriers to Clinical Deployment</div>
      <ul class="barrier-list">
        <li class="barrier-item">
          <div class="barrier-icon">1</div>
          <div>
            <div class="barrier-text">Data Infrastructure</div>
            <div class="barrier-desc">Fragmented EHR systems and lack of interoperability standards</div>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="barrier-item">
          <div class="barrier-icon">2</div>
          <div>
            <div class="barrier-text">Regulatory Uncertainty</div>
            <div class="barrier-desc">Evolving frameworks that lag behind the pace of AI development</div>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="barrier-item">
          <div class="barrier-icon">3</div>
          <div>
            <div class="barrier-text">Clinician Trust</div>
            <div class="barrier-desc">Insufficient explainability and transparency of model outputs</div>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="barrier-item">
          <div class="barrier-icon">4</div>
          <div>
            <div class="barrier-text">Economic Evidence</div>
            <div class="barrier-desc">Limited cost-effectiveness analyses for health-system investment</div>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="barrier-item">
          <div class="barrier-icon">5</div>
          <div>
            <div class="barrier-text">Workflow Integration</div>
            <div class="barrier-desc">Poor alignment of AI tools with existing clinical workflows</div>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- RECOMMENDATIONS -->
  <div class="section-recommendations">
    <div class="section-label">05 / Recommendations</div>
    <div class="section-title">Recommendations &amp; Future Directions</div>
    <div class="rec-grid">
      <div class="rec-card">
        <div class="rec-number">01</div>
        <div class="rec-title">Mandate Prospective Validation</div>
        <div class="rec-desc">Require multi-site and diverse-population trials before clinical deployment.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rec-card">
        <div class="rec-number">02</div>
        <div class="rec-title">Standardise Bias Auditing</div>
        <div class="rec-desc">Implement demographic-stratified performance reporting as a publication requirement.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rec-card">
        <div class="rec-number">03</div>
        <div class="rec-title">Develop Safety Registries</div>
        <div class="rec-desc">Create shared safety-reporting systems analogous to pharmacovigilance for AI-CDSS.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rec-card">
        <div class="rec-number">04</div>
        <div class="rec-title">Invest in Interoperability</div>
        <div class="rec-desc">Adopt open data standards (FHIR, OMOP) to enable seamless data exchange.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rec-card">
        <div class="rec-number">05</div>
        <div class="rec-title">Prioritise Explainability</div>
        <div class="rec-desc">Advance research to build clinician and patient trust in AI-augmented care.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- FOOTER -->
  <div class="footer">
    <div class="footer-text">Source: The Lancet Digital Health (2023) &mdash; Systematic review of 400+ studies evaluating AI-assisted clinical decision support systems</div>
    <div class="footer-right">The Lancet Digital Health &mdash; AI in Clinical Medicine Symposium</div>
  </div>

</div>

